# Fleetbreak Moorings (CIPlay fleetbreak_moorings), STORY 10-24 order: the chart room, the articles, Crane's decree, Teo's log,
# the dive for the flagship's log, the bosun's locker (machete), the
# vines on the stair cut, the boars in the roof garden, the fuel tank and fuel pipe, Teo's log, the biofuel press, the
# strongbox and the Fleet's offer; then the contract: the boom, three filter crates, the Rookery's drop, the receipt.
# offset 0 0 is a placeholder: phase 2 sets it from the recipe's save log (PLAY_FORMAT: Coordinates).
island Fleetbreak Moorings
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title The Free Fleet
zone chart_room
expect step 1
read Free Fleet articles
expect step 2
read Council decree
expect step 3
read Teo's log
expect step 4
# STORY 10-24: the dive comes first - the flagship's log
zone fb_deep
expect step 5
expect stand -71 20 h=-12
open Flagship's deckhouse strongbox
wait 3
expect story fb_deep 1
expect step 6
open Bosun's locker
wait 3
expect step 7
use gardenvines
expect hidden gardenvines
zone roof_garden
expect step 8
kill Warthog
expect animals Warthog 0
expect step 9
open Biofuel press
wait 3
expect step 10
open Fuel tank crate
wait 3
expect step 11
open Fuel store
wait 3
expect step 12
open Fleet strongbox
wait 3
expect story authpass 1
expect step 13
zone gull_ridge
expect step 14
read Harbourmaster's ledger
expect step 15
open Seaplane's crate
wait 3
expect step 16
zone bosuns_cave
expect step 17
zone fb_trail
expect step 18
openat -50.26 -55.44
zone fb_summit
expect step 19
expect stand -41.26 -38.32 h=40
open Fleet's signal mast deck box
wait 3
expect story fb_top 1
expect step 20
read A friend's signal
expect step 21
read Fleet contract offer
expect done
expect step 0 quest=2
expect title Filters Past the Boom quest=2
zone boom
expect step 1 quest=2
openat 27 -80
openat 92 -28
openat -92 -28
expect story filtercrate 3
expect step 2 quest=2
zone rookery_drop
expect step 3 quest=2
read Fleet receipt
expect step 4 quest=2
open Fleet reward
wait 3
expect done quest=2
